{"version":1,"content":"<p>想睇高質四仔作品唔單止係睇脫星，仲要睇埋邊個導演，好似由法國四仔片廠Dorcel推出嘅新作咁，齋睇導演就知係精品！</p><p>呢部作品《Fetish Vol.2》隆重其事搵來歐洲著名四仔王牌導演Herve Bodilis執導，原來呢套係佢自2022年闊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.685363+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:58:04.796446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"feba5ea8fb9ab64906f24e7119266391cb91c6b90853032de18b645915b9ca79","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}